WHAT'S MODIFIED?
- Email formatting can be done easily.
- HTML editor while creating templates.
- More restrictions on user with Interviewer role. facility of scheduling, mailing the candidate etc. is not available for them
- You can change the flags from select as well as hire tab for selected candidate.
- Reply/forward directly from import window.
- While creating position facility to select skills from existing skills is given on Requirements tab.
- If position is closed, all the inprocess candidates are automatically marked as "Moved to Position Closed" instead of reject.
- All screens now displays experience as 1 yrs 6 mos instead on 1.5 yrs
- Enhanced search for multiple branches. Options to search "All words" or "Any word" or "Exact term" available



VENDOR APPLICATION:
Vendor application is an independent application, which you need to deploy on separate system in order to secure talentpool data.
The application is accessible to all vendors.

Vendor accessing application:
Vendor will be able to login into the application using their own username and password. Each vendor can have one or multiple logins.
Vendors will be able to see only positions which are published to them on Positions tab and will be also able to upload resume for selected position.
Vendors will be able to see the entire candidate they uploaded and their current status on Candidates tab.
Vendors will be able to latest activities for their candidates on Activities tab.

Recruiter's role for vendor application:
As a recruiter you will be responsible to publish position to vendor.
You will be responsible to create login for vendor using which they can login.
You can define separate duplicate detection settings for vendors.


Version 1.6.0

What's new?
- Ability to flag candidate. The flag text is customizable. User can apply one or more that one flag to each profile and is able to search based on flags
- LDAP integration. With LDAP integrated in talentpool, User can use windows username and password instead of talentpool username and password.
- Talentpool inbox can be configured to send auto reply email, when email is received.
- Delete applicant is possible with admin rights only
- Offer to join report in summary and detail format
- Candidate comparison report can be used to compare candidates shortlisted for position and also for specific stage

What's modified?
-  Print email with header
-  While importing resumes if same resume is found in the system, system gives an alert as applicant name already exist in the system. This alert is modified to show last resume updated date of the applicant in the system.
-  While creating appointment, user can select template to be used for reminder email and SMS. By default there will one template always selected but user can change the template while creating appointment, this is helpful in case interview is telephonic interview or interview is to be conducted at different location/city
-  Interviewer access is limited and interviewer can not access reports, inbox and screen.
	

